A1: K = 1 jumps
  DB0
A2: K = 9 falls through
  DB0
FELL
B: EXIT PROGRAM
IN SUB
  SB0
BACK
C: INITIALIZE G
  DBG
D: IF YC (I)
T
  DBI
E1: WHEN D not reached
ONE
E2: WHEN D reached
D
  DB0
E3: SEARCH second WHEN not reached
HIT
E4: SEARCH second WHEN reached
HIT2
  DB0
F: unused DEBUG-SUB-1
  DBZ [     ]
  SPACES
END
